    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-zh-390.013",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 13,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 822,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "一次有用的对话，仍然可能很难重新接上。",
        "你记得某件事变清楚了，却不记得准确的说",
        "法、中途补充的约束，或到底在哪个窗口做",
        "了决定。对话确实发生过，连贯却没有自动",
        "到来。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-82640dae68dd",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-zh-390.014",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 14,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 998,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA 想填补的，是这段空隙。它不在每次对",
        "话前要求你准备完美的简报，也不凌驾于你",
        "的表达之上，替你决定你是谁。它在原话旁",
        "边，提供一个工作空间：找回曾经的表达，",
        "看清来源，再决定它是否适合下一步。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-d71c0c3a88e5",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-zh-390.015",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 15,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1174,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "保存一切，不等于善用某一部分。长期档案",
        "里可能有已经不再困扰你的问题、你从未认",
        "同的引文，以及被主动放弃的计划。把它们",
        "全部带进新任务，反而可能淹没你真正想找",
        "回的语境。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-cab99ed91bab",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-zh-390.016",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 16,
      "x1": 24,
      "y1": 1370,
      "x2": 104,
      "y2": 1370,
      "stroke": "#a0a99e",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-zh-390.017",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 17,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1412,
      "width": 337,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 35,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 43,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "真正有用的，",
        "可能是三句话，而不",
        "是三年。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-82a5cd584e11",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-zh-390.018",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 18,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1615,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "选择很重要，修改的能力也同样重要。你可",
        "能希望原始记录保持完整，同时让今天的工",
        "作说明更短、更清楚。只要来源和工作版本",
        "不冒充彼此，这两种需要就并不矛盾。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-9e2ffaaec9e4",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-zh-390.019",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 19,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1762,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "在这样的理解里，上下文不是系统暗中积累",
        "的个人画像，而是你可以查看，并有意带到",
        "某个具体问题里的材料。真正有用的可能是",
        "三句话，而不是三年的记录；真正相关的可",
        "能是你今天早上修改过的版本。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-3c938990e79a",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-zh-390.020",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 20,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1938,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA 从你已经在 AI 对话中产生的表达开始。",
        "它希望带来不依赖维护习惯的连贯：少一点",
        "重建，多一点继续。留下、回看、理解、复",
        "用，不是一条必须走完的流程，而是在过去",
        "的思考再次有用时，让它可以被找到。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-8c7dae4329fb",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-zh-390.021",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 21,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 2140,
      "width": 335,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 11,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 18.15,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#707975",
      "lines": [
        "这是产品观点，不代表相关能力均已发布。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-02dda9d1f87c",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-zh-390.022",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 22,
      "x1": 24,
      "y1": 2241,
      "x2": 366,
      "y2": 2241,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-zh-390.023",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 23,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 2289,
      "width": 330,
